IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `htta-donation`

-- Human Tissue and Transplant Act 1982 (WA), ss 3(1), 9, 16, 22, 23, 24(2) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_human-tissue-and-transplant-act-1982.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario events: chloe c026 (2021-03-20) and daniel d021 (2014-04-09) register as donors at 18; jake k097 (2079-04-18)
-- dies at 72, on the Register since 2047, kidneys donated, survived by his daughter Ruby (46), his sister Chloe (76) and
-- his former wife Tahlia (72, married 2033 to 2039); daniel d092 (2078-10-21) dies at 82, on the Register, survived by his
-- wife Priya (81) and their children Anjali (51) and Luca (48). Being on the Register is entered as the deceased's
-- expressed wish or consent under s 22(2)(a): AN INFERENCE, the Act does not mention the Register. The other cases vary
-- one fact at a time. Jake's parents (ages 108 and 106 in the life) are left out: whether they are living is not stated.

