    `died in a hospital or was brought into one` IS TRUE
    `expressed a wish for or consented to removal in life, not withdrawn` IS FALSE
    `the removal is within the terms of that wish or consent` IS FALSE
    `the officer has reason to believe the deceased objected` IS FALSE
    `the death is or may be a reportable death` IS FALSE
    `the coroner consented or directed that consent is not required` IS FALSE
    `respiration and circulation are maintained by artificial means` IS FALSE
    `two qualifying practitioners declared brain function irreversibly ceased` IS FALSE
    `relatives` IS LIST `an estranged wife, 50, objects`, `a de facto partner, 45, living with him, consents`

